  "1. Create a Gist": "1. Crear un Gist",
  "Start g2muse-relay.json with {\"messages\":[]}. Do not overwrite an existing Gist.": "Inicia g2muse-relay.json con {\"messages\":[]}. No sobrescribas un Gist existente.",
